ady that  stands out for me is that now she  employs about 25 ladies um and she  started out by getting her own machine  and and working so our our motto and our  our philosophy is that you know do  whatever we can to make them stand on  their feet so we we do small business  loans you know we we've bought seeds for  for farmers if the area is safe enough  to where they can they can plant um  we have bought some people for example  you know either either some sheep or  even a a small calf and they they you  know they raise them then they use their  milk and all that and they sell them so  so we do whatever we can to try to  to  bring somebody to stand on their feet  and we monitor them we have them we  provide them even with psychological  support  and social counseling  until we kind of feel that they are able  to now now move on their own we move to  the next you know the next group the  next batch so so that's our model  beautiful and the name of the  organization again is syrian forum usa  god almighty rewards you thank you thank  you thank you i mean except for us  trying to make a difference by creating  awareness  and we'll see you next time here  inshallah  alhamdulillah we are in contract to  purchase this 35 000 square foot  facility to make it the dean center and  in it there will be a masjid inshallah  the last and final messenger sent to  mankind the prophet peace and blessings  be upon him said that the one who helps  build a masjid for allah allah will  build for them a house in jannah get the  tremendous rewards and donate right now  to help purchase this property may god  almighty allah reward all of you  [Music]
 

